        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MB175, Solid Brass Mortise Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of solid brass, the 2-1/2 inch Mortise Bolt has a 1-3/4 backset and a 1/2 inch diameter. Mortise Bolts are used to lock a door on one side. It uses a rack and pinion method to operate the door bolt (turning the knob slides the bolt in or out). Comes packaged with matching finish strike plate and mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MB175-specifications.gif?v=1704354511\" width=\"562\" height=\"177\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MB175 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana MB175 Mortise Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Housing Outside Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged complete with matching finish strike plate and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MB175-specifications.pdf?v=1704262153\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MB175 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MB175-install.pdf?v=1691095375\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MB175 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Mortise Bolt",
                "description": "Deltana MB175 Mortise Bolts - Made out of solid brass, the 2-1/2 inch Mortise Bolt has a 1-3/4 backset and a 1/2 inch diameter. Mortise Bolts are used to lock a door on one side. It uses a rack and pinion method to operate the door bolt (turning the knob slides the bolt in or out). Available in nine different finishes. Comes packaged with matching finish strike plate and mounting screws.",
